        "text": "Paul Kendrick previously served as executive director of Rust Belt Rising, which trains Midwest Democratic candidates. He has worked for the education organization Hope Chicago and in the Obama White House. He was an elected community representative on the local school councils for Lincoln Park High School and Alcott Elementary School.",
